      "english": "I'm taking the HSK3 exam"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小雨：本！我们又见面了！",
      "traditional": "小雨：本！我們又見面了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ běn wǒ men yòu jiàn miàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ben! We meet again!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：是啊，好巧啊！",
      "traditional": "本：是啊，好巧啊！",
      "pinyin": "běn shì a hǎo qiǎo a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Yes, what a coincidence!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：对了，你是不是在看HSK3级的书呢？",
      "traditional": "小雨：對了，你是不是在看HSK3級的書呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ duì le nǐ shì bú shì zài kàn 3 1 jí de shū ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Oh right, aren't you reading an HSK3 book?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：是啊。今年我要考HSK3级。",
      "traditional": "本：是啊。今年我要考HSK3級。",
      "pinyin": "běn shì a jīn nián wǒ yào kǎo 3 1 jí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I am. I will take the HSK3 exam this year."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小雨：我这里有一本很好的HSK3级的书，",
      "traditional": "小雨：我這裡有一本很好的HSK3級的書，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wǒ zhè lǐ yǒu yì běn hěn hǎo de 3 1 jí de shū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "朋友给我的，我也用不到，你拿去看吧！",
      "traditional": "朋友給我的，我也用不到，你拿去看吧！",
      "pinyin": "péng you gěi wǒ de wǒ yě yòng bu dào nǐ ná qù kàn ba",
      "english": "Little Yu: I have a really good HSK3 book here."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My friend gave it to me, but I have no use for it. Why don't you take it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "本：真的吗？太好了！谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "本：真的嗎？太好了！謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "běn zhēn de ma tài hǎo le xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Really? Great! Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小雨：不客气！",
      "traditional": "小雨：不客氣！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Don't mention it!"
    }
  ],
